    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "compound_rare" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Reserved for rare cannabinoids, i.e. the many phytocannabinoids found only in trace amounts (CBDP, THCP and similar). INTENTIONALLY EMPTY: no rare cannabinoid is registered as a concept yet, so this category records a dimension the taxonomy intends to cover rather than a gap or an oversight. Every other category lists its members in skos:narrower."@en .

